1
00:00:19,575 --> 00:00:22,875
Omar wants to borrow 50
dirhams until Friday.

2
00:00:22,935 --> 00:00:24,075
No rule for this.

3
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:39,980
By your rule, Omar borrowed
25 dirhams until Friday.

4
00:01:24,930 --> 00:01:29,670
You said, when a free trial starts,
if it renews, cancel on day six.

5
00:01:29,730 --> 00:01:35,350
Autopilot will cancel the Pixel Pass trial
on day six before the 29 dirhams charge.

6
00:01:35,705 --> 00:01:39,565
When a friend asks for money,
if over 20 dirhams lend half.

7
00:01:39,625 --> 00:01:40,615
On Thursday,

8
00:01:40,665 --> 00:01:46,215
Omar asked you to cover his 100 dirhams
deposit until his pocket money comes.

9
00:01:46,265 --> 00:01:47,645
He got 50 dirhams.
